@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #0b7a75
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #6b7280
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #0b7a75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #fdfdfd
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #f3f4f6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9ca3af

title flow_client_utterance -- client-sessioned, free text\nA person types a request; the navigator triages the session, determines the page, mines it, dispatches the set, reconciles the page, and answers.

actor "Person / Client" as P
participant "Gate\n(facade)" as GATE
participant "UniversalNavigator\n(SharedServices)" as UN
database "render ledger\n+ sessions (repo rows)" as REPO
participant "UtteranceManager" as UM
participant "co-resident tool\n(SharedServices)" as CT
participant "UniversalNavigatorProxy\n(satellite)" as PXY
participant "satellite tool" as ST
participant "Prose tool" as PROSE

P -> GATE : POST free-text utterance\nsession_token + head + params\nAccept: application/x-ndjson
note right of GATE
  Dumb transport. The gate collects
  the token, head and params, streams
  the answer back, verifies nothing,
  owns no route.
end note
GATE -> UN : pass(token, head, params)

== Triage: which of the five types is this? ==
UN -> UN : route is **client_sessioned**\nproof = session_token
UN -> REPO : load session by GUID
UN -> UN : verify token + restamp per-hop nonce
note right of UN
  The UniversalNavigator is the only node
  that takes external traffic. It triages
  every arrival by its declared proof.
end note

== Determine the page ==
UN -> UN : read the map: this request\nconstructs page **care_giver**
UN -> REPO : ledger: record the page's\n**required_members** as expectations

== Mine (one model call, page-scoped) ==
UN -> UM : preamble + THIS page's member fragments\n(page-scoped mining)
UM -> UM : one model call; knows no parameters
UM --> UN : the dispatch **set** of routes (non-blocking)
UN -> UN : validate the set against the **may_call** DAG

== Dispatch the set in parallel ==
UN -> CT : dispatch (co-resident = direct call)
UN -> PXY : dispatch across the wire (tool_to_tool)
PXY -> ST : relay locally (function call)

CT --> UN : internal_callback (proof: our_signature)
UN -> REPO : ledger: close entry; merge serially
ST --> PXY : result document
PXY --> UN : internal_callback (proof: our_signature)
UN -> REPO : ledger: close entry; merge serially

note over UN, REPO
  Serial deterministic merge (shared lib). A parameter/state
  conflict RAISES (on_conflict). A required member that dies
  or never returns RAISES (on_missing_required). Every throw
  ends here in the navigator, instrumented with timings.
end note

== Reconcile the page ==
alt every required_member closed within the budget
  UN -> UN : page reconciled
else completeness budget expires first
  UN -> UN : page NOT rendered in time\n-> answer with layman **on_timeout** explanation
end

UN -> PROSE : dispatch with the facts
PROSE --> UN : the user-facing sentence

UN -> REPO : persist the mutated user_object
UN -> GATE : stream events + final\n(the gate owns the one stream)
GATE -> P : rendered page / final\n{ok, guid, time_remaining, session_token}

@enduml
